msgid "will be lost/reset."
msgstr "caillfear/athshocrófar iad!"

msgid "Last config file used to build this data file was"
msgstr "Ba é an comhad cumraíochta deireanach a úsáideadh chun an comhad sonraí seo a thógáil"

msgid "Position (offset in bytes) in this file for beginning of each section for"
msgstr "Ionad (cúiteamh i mbeart) sa comhad seo do thús gach rannóige do"

msgid "direct I/O access. If you made changes somewhere in this file, you should"
msgstr "rochtain I/O dhíreach. Má rinne tú athruithe áit éigin sa comhad seo, ba cheart duit"

